#MOBILE
Vnum       40401
Keywords   miarta sek master temple~
Short      Miarta Sek~
Long       Miarta Sek sits motionless, eyes closed, at the center of the chamber.
~
Desc       Miarta Sek, Master of Qigong Kesh, is so still in meditation
that visitors sometimes mistake her for a statue - until she speaks,
usually answering a question they haven't asked yet.
~
